nvidia-legacy-71xx-driver is a metapackage. It pulls in the runtime
libraries, the Xorg driver, the utilities, the kernel-support glue and (for the
DKMS flavour) the DKMS module source for NVIDIA 71.86.15.

Hardware: TNT/TNT2, GeForce 256, GeForce 2/4 MX (NV0x, NV1x)
Upstream status: Upstream EOL 2011. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 2. Very high risk.

To remove every trace:  apt purge '~nnvidia-legacy-71xx-.*'
